<title>POLAND: FORTE FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 0.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>FORTE FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 0.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.64 vs   1.45</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.06 vs   1.45</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.17 vs   2.51</p>
<p> Sales		   25.01 vs  22.49</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.08 vs   3.32</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.45 vs   3.32</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.55 vs   4.89</p>
<p> Sales		   52.65 vs  45.19</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish furniture maker is Fabryki Mebli</p>
<p>Forte SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
